{"slug":"oxygen_","name":"Oxygen","description":"Oxygen is a Fabric mod for Minecraft that boosts FPS through smart entity and block-entity culling, frustum checks, and density-based rendering. It also adds memory optimizations and handy video options like camera zoom. Lightweight and fast!","author":"laeb","icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q9WsW2Bm/156f68a1afa795d9645cd93564b662348cbcf44d_96.webp","download_count":587,"supported_versions":[{"name":"1.21.10","channel":"release"},{"name":"1.21.11","channel":"release"}],"supported_loaders":[{"id":"fabric","name":"Fabric"}]}